            INPS contributions are capped by an indexed statutory ceiling (<em>massimale contributivo</em>) set at <strong>€119,650</strong>. Gross income earned above this ceiling is subject to <strong>0% INPS pension tax</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
          <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2">100% Tax Deductibility</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-300">
            Every euro remitted to INPS is an <strong>onere deducibile</strong>, meaning it directly reduces your taxable IRPEF base in the year paid.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800">
          <h4 class="text-white font-bold text-sm mb-2">Forfettario Coefficient Multiplier</h4>
